  "title": "Quick Nutty Portuguese Vermicelli Pasta",
  "description": "A nutty and light Portuguese dish featuring vermicelli pasta, made in a traditional tajine clay vessel, perfect for a weeknight dinner.",
  "cuisine": "Portuguese",
